@startuml
[*] --> CreatingTask : Create Task
CreatingTask --> EditingTask : Edit Task
CreatingTask --> DeletingTask : Delete Task
CreatingTask --> AssigningTask : Assign Task
EditingTask --> CreatingTask : Save Changes
EditingTask --> DeletingTask : Delete Task
AssigningTask --> TrackingProgress : Task Assigned
TrackingProgress --> NotifyingCompletion : Task Completed
NotifyingCompletion --> [*] : Notification Sent
DeletingTask --> [*] : Task Deleted
[*] --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
